  by joining Dark Sky Ranger Kale Wernsing for an exploration of why darkne
 ss matters to everyone and everything\, from people to plants.\n\nWith a f
 ocus on both academic research and industry implications\, Ranger Kale wil
 l explore the role the National Park Service has played in the push for da
 rk sky preservation\, and how the Southeast Utah Group is particularly inv
 olved in this effort.
