DESCRIPTION:May 21 | Wildlife Tracking: Unraveling the Mysteries Around Us
  by Jonathan Jessop\nJoin Canyonlands National Park Ranger Jonathan Jessop
  as he explores the art and science of wildlife tracking. Discover how tra
 cking can deepen your awareness and connection to the natural world\, whil
 e learning the fundamentals through examples of local species that help gu
 ide and inform our understanding.
